{
    "prompt": "In this image, all directions are relative to the frame. A pixel art scene featuring a gray elephant to the right of a tree. The elephant holds all the pizzas, which are resting on it.",
    "dsl": "(and (IsStyle 'pixel art') (exists ?e (exists ?t (and (Is ?e 'elephant') (HasColor ?e 'gray') (Is ?t 'tree') (RightOf ?e ?t) (forall ?p (implies (Is ?p 'pizza') (and (Holding ?e ?p) (On ?p ?e))))))))",
    "cnf": "(and (IsStyle 'pixel art') (exists ?e (exists ?t (forall ?p (and (Is ?e 'elephant') (HasColor ?e 'gray') (RightOf ?e ?t) (or (not (Is ?p 'pizza')) (Holding ?e ?p)) (Is ?t 'tree') (or (not (Is ?p 'pizza')) (On ?p ?e)))))))",
    "k": 3,
    "object_classes": [
        "elephant",
        "tree",
        "pizza"
    ]
